Short:        Strips comments from source codes. V1.3
Author:       Hans-Peter Guenther
Version:      1.3
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection

A programming utility that strips all kinds of comments from given source
codes of all programming languages.  It is controlled by a config file
which includes the rules of the comment chars.  Some configuration files
included. OS 2.xx only.  
